o Surefine issued a demand promissory note to the creditor, Advantage Life & Annuity Company Limited. (Advantage) for the death benefit amounts;
o Advantage assigned Relius a note; it also assigned a note to TriCap, and TriCap further assigned it to Relius;
o Advantage issued to Surefine a demand for payment of a settlement amount equal to the death benefit amounts which it would receive in full and final satisfaction of any amounts under an Investment Agreement, and on account for premiums outstanding on the ’01 and ’03 Policies;
o Advantage paid to Surefine the amounts owed under its obligations on the Policies, and issued a confirmation to evidence the payment;
o Surefine issued a receipt to Relius as confirmation that it has received the payment of the death benefit amount in satisfaction of the loan agreement;
